<title>USA: Effective Management gets software contract.</title>
<headline>Effective Management gets software contract.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Effective Management Systems Inc, which markets pre-integrated manufacturing software, said it received a major contract for its Time Critical Manufacturing (TCM) software from Douglas Dynamics LLC, a unit of Armco Inc.</p>
<p>It said the contract calls for Effective Management to provide more than $1 million in TCM software and related services over the next year and a half to various Douglas Dynamics' plants.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
